{"id":"krepko","lemma":"крепко","pos":"adv","rank":1786,"glosses":["firmly, solidly, fast, strong, hard"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a7/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Она крепко спала в своей комнате.","en":"She was sound asleep in her room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/674429","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"to sleep","l":"спать"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Держись крепко, пожалуйста.","en":"Please hold on tight.","words":[{"g":"to hold on","l":"держаться"},null,{"g":"please"}]},{"text":"Моя дочь крепко спит.","en":"My daughter is fast asleep.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"daughter"},null,{"g":"to sleep","l":"спать"}]},{"text":"Можно тебя крепко обнять?","en":"Can I give you a hug?","words":[{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to hug, to embrace"}]},{"text":"Он крепко спал.","en":"He was fast asleep.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to sleep","l":"спать"}]}]}